# The Tide Engine's coolant sump without a suit (CIPlay the_tide_engine_acid, 11-12 w07; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in its recipe: the sump at 30 -30 (floor ~3.6, zone r 3.4, safe=suit), the suit box at 35.6 -35.2, the
# sign at 36.9 -33.6. Into the sump: hurt and the message; out again up its slope.
island The Tide Engine keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
expect shown tesump
picture te_sump_out 39 9 -39 30 4 -30
at 36 -34 h=5.5
wait 2
read THE SUMP - COOLANT
walk 36 -34 to 33 -32 to 30 -30
wait 8
expect message spent coolant
expect hurt 10
walk 30 -30 to 33 -32 to 37 -35
wait 2
expect hurt 1
